      "en": "They went away, and found a young donkey tied at the door outside in the open street, and they untied him.",
      "ko": "제자들이 가서 본즉 나귀 새끼가 문앞 거리에 매여 있는지라 그것을 푸니",
      "source_text_hash": "562d632b0b7c4c158a4a364af66adb5c7446ab4329e4e5288b2657318bf48351",
      "translation_text_hash": "e55dfdeaadda1a166ca5f40cd677750ccfa4990c9b7df1cab39083e3747f6013",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "제자들이 가서 본즉 나귀 새끼가 문앞 거리에 매여 있는지라 그것을 푸니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e55dfdeaadda1a166ca5f40cd677750ccfa4990c9b7df1cab39083e3747f6013"
