      "en": "They said to them just as Jesus had said, and they let them go.",
      "ko": "제자들이 예수의 이르신대로 말한대 이에 허락하는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "eaf2c7f7f92dc5c2ad87588bc1be24b325eef52a5ff1e1647fd12ac0faae1f38",
      "translation_text_hash": "9d1f9727a7b6e9596d21e378cf20f2aecd78df17818caec6663b6e93baad1929",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
