      "en": "Jesus entered into the temple in Jerusalem. When he had looked around at everything, it being now evening, he went out to Bethany with the twelve.",
      "ko": "예수께서 예루살렘에 이르러 성전에 들어가사 모든 것을 둘러 보시고 때가 이미 저물매 열 두 제자를 데리시고 베다니에 나가시다",
      "source_text_hash": "769748ffdbe8e8db8b5c199d3b28fb425cce5bfbb24acc7a364418e618d45fdb",
      "translation_text_hash": "2b7749abcd6c9d5192bc9a7d8293c83c66061a02f23a60c638905d47b1dcee52",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
