      "en": "The next day, when they had come out from Bethany, he was hungry.",
      "ko": "이튿날 저희가 베다니에서 나왔을 때에 예수께서 시장하신지라",
      "source_text_hash": "542ecf9cb35541f6c93b6186e776f21e25712f9c318444b7e1cb80a932fc50e0",
      "translation_text_hash": "98a609422f928847a0cbb462963b6dab742f2885b8244600c474fbe680f6727f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이튿날 저희가 베다니에서 나왔을 때에 예수께서 시장하신지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "98a609422f928847a0cbb462963b6dab742f2885b8244600c474fbe680f6727f"
      ]
